@startuml

title CJM: Обработка заказа рестораном

participant "Avito Kitchen" as Kitchen
participant "Restaurant Service" as Restaurant
database "Restaurant DB" as DB

Kitchen -> Restaurant: POST /api/v1/orders
Restaurant -> DB: Создать заказ
DB --> Restaurant: Order (new)
Restaurant --> Kitchen: restaurant_order_id

== Обработка заказа ==

Restaurant -> DB: Изменить статус: accepted
DB --> Restaurant: Order (accepted)

Restaurant -> Kitchen: POST /integration/orders/status\nstatus = accepted
Kitchen --> Restaurant: 200 OK

... 5 секунд ...

Restaurant -> DB: Изменить статус: cooking
DB --> Restaurant: Order (cooking)

Restaurant -> Kitchen: POST /integration/orders/status\nstatus = cooking
Kitchen --> Restaurant: 200 OK

... 5 секунд ...

Restaurant -> DB: Изменить статус: ready
DB --> Restaurant: Order (ready)

Restaurant -> Kitchen: POST /integration/orders/status\nstatus = ready
Kitchen --> Restaurant: 200 OK

@enduml